17	2	82	\N	News and announcements	news	4	2016-07-04 23:06:05.824736	2016-07-19 22:36:49.243006	GeneralContent	\N	published	129caa4c-d858-435b-8f15-62a6586023da	\N	\N	{"name": "News", "content_body": "** The latest department news, announcements, media releases, interviews, speeches and more.**\\r\\n\\r\\n<div class=\\"sort-container\\">\\r\\n<span>Sort by:</span>\\r\\n<ul class=\\"news-sort-tabs\\">\\r\\n<li><a href=\\"javascript:void(0)\\" class=\\"active\\">Most recent</a></li>\\r\\n<li><a href=\\"javascript:void(0)\\">Oldest to newest</a></li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n\\r\\n#### [Draft report on review of the ACMA released](announcements/2016-05-06-draft-report-review-acma.html)  \\r\\nDate published: 6 May 2016  \\r\\nThe Department of Communications and the Arts has released the draft report on the review of the ACMA.\\r\\n\\r\\n#### [Catalyst—Australian Arts and Culture Fund supports more than 70 innovative projects](javascript:void(0))  \\r\\nDate published: 2 May 2016  \\r\\n$10 million for more than 70 projects through the Catalyst Australian Arts and Culture Fund.\\r\\n\\r\\n#### [New eSafety Women website launched](javascript:void(0))  \\r\\nDate published: 28 April 2016  \\r\\nA new website which empowers women to take control online and protect themselves from technology-facilitated abuse.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<a class=\\"see-more\\" href=\\"/news.html\\">See all Government news</a>"}	\N
41	6	85	\N	Contact us	contact-us	8	2016-07-06 01:00:40.79528	2016-08-01 02:17:54.732048	GeneralContent	\N	published	266b98fc-547d-4f25-8e05-1cef26cecb7e	\N	\N	{"name": "Contact us", "options": {"toc": 1}, "content_body": "## Email\\r\\n\\r\\n**General enquiries**  \\r\\n__________@border.gov.au \\r\\n\\r\\n**Cargo Support Centre**  \\r\\nGet information on the status of cargo for businesses, agents and trade professionals.  \\r\\n[cargosupport@border.gov.au](mailto:cargosupport@border.gov.au)  \\r\\nFor more information, visit our [Cargo support page](#).\\r\\n\\r\\n**Media enquiries**  \\r\\n[media@border.gov.au](mailto:media@border.gov.au)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Contact form](http://www.border.gov.au/about/contact/make-enquiry/general)**\\r\\n\\r\\n## Phone\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you have a hearing or speech impairment, please use the [National Relay Service](http://relayservice.gov.au/) to access any of our listed phone numbers.  \\r\\nTelephone: [1300 555 727](tel:1300555727)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**General enquiries**  \\r\\n[131 881](tel:131881)  \\r\\n8:30am - 4:30pm AEST (Australian Eastern Standard Time)  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Cargo Support Centre**  \\r\\nTelephone: [1300 558 099](tel:1300558099)  \\r\\nTelephone (urgent clearances): [02 6275 6100](tel:0262756100)  \\r\\n7am - 7pm  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays  \\r\\n9am - 5pm  \\r\\nSaturday to Sunday  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Report something suspicious**  \\r\\nIf you suspect that someone is working illegally, has no right to be in Australia, is involved in smuggling or other criminal activities, we want to hear from you.  \\r\\nFreecall: [1800 009 623](tel:1800009623)  \\r\\nTelephone (International): [61 2 6246 1325](tel:61262461325)  \\r\\n9am – 5pm AEST (Australian Eastern Standard Time)  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Give us feedback**  \\r\\nWe use your feedback to improve our services to industry and the community, and investigate any issues of concern.  \\r\\n[133 177](tel:133177)  \\r\\n9am – 5pm AEST (Australian Eastern Standard Time)  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays\\r\\n\\r\\n**Media enquiries**  \\r\\n[02 6264 2244](tel:0262642244)  \\r\\n9am – 5pm AEST (Australian Eastern Standard Time)  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays  \\r\\n\\r\\n## Locations and opening hours\\r\\n\\r\\n### Offices overseas\\r\\n\\r\\n[A-Z list of countries](#)  \\r\\n\\r\\n### Offices in Australia\\r\\n\\r\\nOur offices are located around the country but not all services are available at all locations.  \\r\\n\\r\\n#### Australian Capital Territory\\r\\n\\r\\n* [Canberra - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [National Office](#)  \\r\\n\\r\\n#### New South Wales\\r\\n\\r\\n* [Coffs Harbour - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Eden - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Newcastle - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Norfolk Island - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Parramatta - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [Richmond - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Sydney - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Sydney - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [Wollongong - District Office](#)  \\r\\n\\r\\n#### Northern Territory\\r\\n\\r\\n* [Darwin - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Darwin - International Airport](#)\\r\\n* [Darwin - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [Nhulunby - Customs House](#)  \\r\\n\\r\\n#### Queensland\\r\\n\\r\\n* [Bowen - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Brisbane - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Brisbane - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [Bundaberg - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Cairns - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Cairns - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [Gladstone - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Gold Coast - International Airport](#)\\r\\n* [Mackay - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Thursday Island - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Thursday Island - Visa Office](#)\\r\\n* [Townsville - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Weipa - District Office](#)  \\r\\n\\r\\n#### South Australia\\r\\n\\r\\n* [Adelaide - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [Port Adelaide - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Port Lincoln - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Port Pirie - Customs House](#)  \\r\\n\\r\\n#### Tasmania\\r\\n\\r\\n* [Hobart - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [Launceston - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Tasmania - Regional Office](#)  \\r\\n\\r\\n#### Victoria\\r\\n\\r\\n* [Dandenong - Visa Office](#)\\r\\n* [Melbourne - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Melbourne - International Airport](#)\\r\\n* [Melbourne - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [Tullamarine - Customs House](#)  \\r\\n\\r\\n#### Western Australia\\r\\n\\r\\n* [Albany - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Broome - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Bunbury - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Carnarvon - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Christmas Island - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Dampier - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Esperance - District Office](#)\\r\\n* [Geraldton - Customs House](#)\\r\\n* [Perth - Airport Client Services Counter](#)\\r\\n* [Perth - Visa and Citizenship Office](#)\\r\\n* [Port Hedland - Customs House](#)\\r\\n\\r\\n## Postal address\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Manager, Global Feedback Unit  \\r\\nGPO Box 241  \\r\\nMelbourne 3001  \\r\\nAustralia  \\r\\n\\r\\n## Social media\\r\\n\\r\\n**Facebook:**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [Australian Department of Immigration and Border Protection](https://www.facebook.com/DIBPAustralia)  \\r\\n* [Australian Border Force](https://www.facebook.com/AustralianBorderForce)\\r\\n\\r\\n**Twitter:**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [@DIBPAustralia](https://twitter.com/DIBPAustralia)  \\r\\n* [@AusBorderForce](https://twitter.com/AusBorderForce)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Instagram:**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [DIBP Australia](https://www.instagram.com/dibpaustralia/)  \\r\\n* [Australian Border Force](https://www.instagram.com/ausborderforce/)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**YouTube:**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [Border TV](https://www.youtube.com/user/ImmiTV)  \\r\\n* [ABF TV](https://www.youtube.com/user/AusCustomsNews)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**LinkedIn:**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [Australian Department of Immigration and Border Protection](https://www.linkedin.com/company/department-of-immigration-and-border-protection)  \\r\\n\\r\\n## How we handle enquiries\\r\\n\\r\\n**[Client Service Charter](#)**  \\r\\nWe aim to provide you with a high level of service.  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Complaints Handling Policy](#)**  \\r\\nHow to complain about us and have your concerns addressed.\\r\\n    \\r\\n**[Privacy Policy](#)**  \\r\\nHow we handle personal and sensitive information.  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Reporting Fraud Policy](#)**  \\r\\nYou are strongly encouraged to report any suspected fraud incidents against us.  \\r\\n    \\r\\n**[Public Interest Disclosure](#)**  \\r\\nHow to report serious wrongdoing in the Commonwealth public sector.  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Freedom of information (FOI) requests](#)**  \\r\\nLearn more about our FOI obligations and how to make a request.  ", "short_summary": "You can contact us in a number of ways."}	2016-08-01 02:17:54.728842
