97	4	83	\N	\N	retransmitting-tv-channels	2	2016-07-22 02:28:31.882754	2016-07-29 06:45:15.822329	GeneralContent	\N	published	d189df67-1969-4328-80ba-15184894fc8d	\N	\N	{"name": "Retransmitting TV channels", "options": {"toc": 1}, "content_body": "##Overview \\r\\nIn areas with variable or no free-to-air TV reception, individuals can apply for satellite TV through the [Viewer Access Satellite Television (VAST)](https://www.myvast.com.au/) service.  \\r\\n\\r\\nLocal groups in these areas, like councils or mining companies, can choose to retransmit digital TV so everyone within their local community has good reception without using a satellite.  \\r\\n\\r\\nThese groups apply to become a self-help provider and supply their own infrastructure.  \\r\\n\\r\\n##Who can provide retransmission services?  \\r\\n\\r\\nTo retransmit channels, you need to apply to the Australian Communications and Media Authority (ACMA) to become a self-help provider.  \\r\\n\\r\\nSelf-help providers include:\\r\\n\\r\\n* local government bodies like councils  \\r\\n* mining, petroleum, oil and gas companies in remote areas  \\r\\n* individuals within particular buildings or areas, approved on a case-by-case basis.  \\r\\n\\r\\nThe ACMA will review your application under section 34 of the Broadcasting Services Act 1992 (BSA).  \\r\\n\\r\\nThey will assess whether:\\r\\n\\r\\n* TV reception will be substantially better than the broadcaster-provided service  \\r\\n* all channels will be available in the area specified in your application  \\r\\n* the spectrum will meet certain technical specifications.  \\r\\n\\r\\n##How to apply  \\r\\nComplete the application form and fax, email or mail it to the ACMA.\\r\\n\\r\\n**[Download application form [PDF 365 KB]](#)**  \\r\\n**[Download application form [Word document 97 KB]](#)**  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Email**  \\r\\n[BCP@acma.gov.au](mailto:BCP@acma.gov.au)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Post**  \\r\\nBroadcast Carriage Policy Section  \\r\\nAustralian Communications and Media Authority  \\r\\nPO Box 78  \\r\\nBELCONNEN ACT 2616  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Fax**  \\r\\n02 6219 5347  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Phone:**  \\r\\n[1300 850 115](tel:1300850115)", "short_summary": "In remote areas with poor TV reception, local organisations can apply to retransmit channels. "}	2016-07-29 06:45:15.819938
