36	6	85	\N	Careers	careers	3	2016-07-06 00:59:29.068797	2016-07-29 00:00:20.198604	GeneralContent	\N	published	2b4506ea-ecd7-4965-976a-cf52d96eee46	\N	\N	{"name": "Careers", "options": {"toc": 1, "suppress_in_nav": false}, "content_body": "## What we work on\\r\\n\\r\\nWe protect Australia’s border and manage the ​movement of people and goods across it.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe manage migration programs, citizenship, trade, customs and more.\\r\\n\\r\\n[Learn more about our role](/department-of-immigration-and-border-protection/our-role).\\r\\n\\r\\n## Job opportunities\\r\\n\\r\\n### [Current job opportunities](https://career10.successfactors.com/career?company=DIAC)\\r\\nSee what roles we have available now.\\r\\n\\r\\n### [Graduate Program](#)\\r\\nGraduate employment opportunities are usually advertised between February and June.\\r\\n\\r\\n### [Working in the Australian Border Force](#)\\r\\nBorder Force officers manage the security and integrity of Australia's borders.\\r\\n\\r\\n### [Careers for Indigenous Australians](#)\\r\\nThere are a variety of career opportunities available for Indigenous Australians within our Department.\\r\\n \\r\\n### [Careers for people with disabilities](#)\\r\\nWe’re committed to recruiting people with disability.\\r\\n\\r\\n## The benefits of working here\\r\\n\\r\\nWe offer challenging and diverse careers that touch upon many parts of Australian life: industry and commerce, trade and travel, our national security and more.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor more details on any of the items below, please see [Employment agreement information](#).\\r\\n\\r\\n### Locations\\r\\n\\r\\nOur employees work in over 100 locations in Australia and overseas, across a range of interesting subject areas influenced by international and domestic developments.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Competitive remuneration package\\r\\n\\r\\nWe offer a good salary, generous leave conditions (including carer’s leave) and an attractive superannuation scheme.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Flexible working arrangements\\r\\n\\r\\nWe support flexible work arrangements as well as flexible working hours for some but not all roles.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Study assistance\\r\\n\\r\\nWe may provide assistance for employees undertaking tertiary education relevant to our operational needs including:\\r\\n\\r\\n* financial assistance\\r\\n* study leave\\r\\n* access to flexible working arrangements for study purposes\\r\\n\\r\\n### Learning and development\\r\\n\\r\\nOur employees have opportunities for learning and development throughout their careers including:  \\r\\n\\r\\n* training processes – such as e-learning platforms, the Global Integrated Curriculum and a learning management system\\r\\n* career pathways – to support good development decisions and directions\\r\\nsuccession planning – to ensure current employees are ready to fill the department's critical roles\\r\\n* leadership strategy – to acknowledge that good leadership is vital to a highly productive and effective organisation.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n### Employee Assistance Program (EAP)\\r\\n\\r\\nThe EAP is a confidential, professional short-term counselling service. It is a free service for our employees and their immediate families.\\r\\n\\r\\n### Workplace diversity\\r\\n\\r\\nWe acknowledge that the diversity of our people is our greatest strength. A diverse workplace will have a greater understanding of its clients and the needs of the community. We aim to create an environment that values people with different backgrounds, experiences and perspectives.​​\\r\\n\\r\\n### Carers’ room\\r\\n\\r\\nWhere possible, a carers’ room will be available for staff who need to take care of immediate family members in an emergency. It gives people an alternative to using leave. Conditions of use apply.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Employment agreement information\\r\\n\\r\\nOur enterprise agreement sets the terms and conditions for our employees:\\r\\n\\r\\n* [Department of Immigration and Border Protection Enterprise Agreement 2011–14](#)\\r\\n\\r\\n## How to apply\\r\\n\\r\\nVisit our [How to apply page](#) to learn more about:\\r\\n\\r\\n* how to prepare your application,\\r\\n* our engagement conditions,\\r\\n* the selection process and more.", "short_summary": "Information on current vacancies, the benefits of working here and how to apply for job opportunities."}	2016-07-29 00:00:20.195741
