20	2	82	\N	Contact us	contact-us	8	2016-07-04 23:11:34.643322	2016-08-02 00:12:56.447578	GeneralContent	\N	published	1b97dcab-9355-41bf-abe4-aeceeb96e6c1	\N	\N	{"name": "Contact us", "options": {"toc": 1}, "summary": "", "content_body": "## Email  \\r\\n\\r\\n**General enquiries**  \\r\\n__________@communications.gov.au\\r\\n\\r\\n**Copyright enquiries**  \\r\\n[copyright@communications.gov.au](mailto:copyright@communications.gov.au)\\r\\n\\r\\n**Media enquiries**  \\r\\n[media@communications.gov.au](mailto:media@communications.gov.au)\\r\\n\\r\\n[Contact form](https://www.communications.gov.au/who-we-are/contact-us/form)\\r\\n\\r\\n## Phone\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you have a hearing or speech impairment, use the [National Relay Service](http://relayservice.gov.au/) to access any of our listed phone numbers.  \\r\\nTelephone: [1300 555 727](tel:1300555727)\\r\\n\\r\\n**General enquiries**  \\r\\n[02 6271 1000](tel:+61262711000)  \\r\\nFree call: [1800 254 649](tel:1800254649)  \\r\\n9am – 5pm AEST (Australian Eastern Standard Time)  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Media enquiries**  \\r\\n[02 6271 1777](tel:+61262711777)\\r\\n9am – 5pm AEST<br>\\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays\\r\\n\\r\\n## Locations and opening hours\\r\\n\\r\\n38 Sydney Avenue  \\r\\nForrest ACT 2608  \\r\\n\\r\\n9am – 5pm AEST  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays  \\r\\n\\r\\n## Postal address\\r\\n\\r\\nDepartment of Communications and the Arts  \\r\\nGPO Box 2154  \\r\\nCanberra ACT 2601  \\r\\nAustralia\\r\\n\\r\\n## Social media\\r\\n\\r\\n**Linkedin:**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [Department of Communications and the Arts](https://www.linkedin.com/company/commsau)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Twitter:**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [@CommsAu](https://twitter.com/CommsAu)  \\r\\n* [@ArtsCultureGov](https://twitter.com/ArtsCultureGov)\\r\\n\\r\\n**Youtube:**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [Department of Communications and the Arts](https://www.youtube.com/user/DeptCommsAu)  \\r\\n\\r\\n## How we handle enquiries\\r\\n\\r\\n**[Client Service Charter](#)**  \\r\\nWe aim to provide you with a high level of service.  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Complaints Handling Policy](#)**  \\r\\nHow to complain about us and have your concerns addressed.\\r\\n    \\r\\n**[Privacy Policy](#)**  \\r\\nHow we handle personal and sensitive information.  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Reporting Fraud Policy](#)**  \\r\\nYou are strongly encouraged to report any suspected fraud incidents against us.  \\r\\n    \\r\\n**[Public Interest Disclosure](#)**  \\r\\nHow to report serious wrongdoing in the Commonwealth public sector.  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Freedom of information (FOI) requests](#)**  \\r\\nLearn more about our FOI obligations and how to make a request.  ", "short_summary": "You can contact us in a number of ways."}	2016-08-02 00:12:56.44302
