59	7	86	\N	Contact us	contact-us	8	2016-07-06 01:06:36.861032	2016-08-02 00:19:27.304224	GeneralContent	\N	published	0f6d7d8e-c994-4891-9d68-b58b57659c3f	\N	\N	{"name": "Contact us", "options": {"toc": 1}, "content_body": "## Email\\r\\n\\r\\n**General enquiries**  \\r\\n__________@pmc.gov.au\\r\\n\\r\\n**The Fraud helpdesk**  \\r\\n[fraud@pmc.gov.au](mailto:fraud@pmc.gov.au)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Complaints**  \\r\\n[complaints@pmc.gov.au](mailto:complaints@pmc.gov.au)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Media enquiries**  \\r\\n[media@pmc.gov.au](mailto:media@pmc.gov.au)  \\r\\n\\r\\n[Contact form](http://www.dpmc.gov.au/contact-us#form)\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n## Phone\\r\\n\\r\\nIf you have a hearing or speech impairment, use the [National Relay Service](http://relayservice.gov.au/) to access any of our listed phone numbers.  \\r\\nTelephone: [1300 555 727](tel:1300555727)\\r\\n\\r\\n**General enquiries**  \\r\\n[02 6271 5111](tel:0262715111)  \\r\\n9am - 5pm  \\r\\nMonday to Friday  \\r\\nFax: 02 6271 5414\\r\\n\\r\\n**Regional network offices**  \\r\\nToll free: [1800 079 098](tel:1800079098)\\r\\n\\r\\n**The Fraud hotline**  \\r\\n[02 6152 3598](tel:0261523598)\\r\\n\\r\\n**Complaints**  \\r\\n[02 6271 5688](tel:0262715688)\\r\\n\\r\\n**Media enquiries**  \\r\\n[02 6271 6039](tel:0262716039)  \\r\\n8:30am - 5:30 pm  \\r\\nMonday to Friday  \\r\\nAfter hours: [0417 164 189](tel:0417164189)  \\r\\n\\r\\n## Locations and opening hours\\r\\n\\r\\n**Barton**  \\r\\n1 National Circuit  \\r\\nBarton ACT 2600  \\r\\n9am – 5pm AEST  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Woden**  \\r\\nCentraplaza  \\r\\n16 Bowes Place  \\r\\nWoden ACT 2606  \\r\\n9am – 5pm AEST  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Phillip**  \\r\\nLovett Tower  \\r\\n13 Keltie Street  \\r\\nPhillip ACT 2606  \\r\\n9am – 5pm AEST  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays  \\r\\n\\r\\n## Postal addresses\\r\\n\\r\\n**General enquiries**  \\r\\nDepartment of the Prime Minister and Cabinet  \\r\\nPO Box 6500  \\r\\nCanberra ACT 2600  \\r\\nAustralia  \\r\\n\\r\\n**Complaints**  \\r\\nComplaints  \\r\\nMinisterial Support Division  \\r\\nDepartment of the Prime Minister and Cabinet  \\r\\nPO Box 6500  \\r\\nCanberra ACT 2600  \\r\\n\\r\\n## Social media\\r\\n\\r\\n**Twitter**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [@pmc\\\\_gov\\\\_au](https://twitter.com/pmc_gov_au)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**YouTube**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [Department of the Prime Minister and Cabinet](https://www.youtube.com/user/AusGovDPMC)  \\r\\n\\r\\n**LinkedIn**  \\r\\n\\r\\n* [Department of the Prime Minister and Cabinet](https://www.linkedin.com/company/department-of-the-prime-minister-and-cabinet)  \\r\\n\\r\\n## How we handle enquiries\\r\\n\\r\\n**[Client Service Charter](#)**  \\r\\nWe aim to provide you with a high level of service.  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Complaints Handling Policy](#)**  \\r\\nHow to complain about us and have your concerns addressed.\\r\\n    \\r\\n**[Privacy Policy](#)**  \\r\\nHow we handle personal and sensitive information.  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Reporting Fraud Policy](#)**  \\r\\nYou are strongly encouraged to report any suspected fraud incidents against us.  \\r\\n    \\r\\n**[Public Interest Disclosure](#)**  \\r\\nHow to report serious wrongdoing in the Commonwealth public sector.  \\r\\n\\r\\n**[Freedom of information (FOI) requests](#)**  \\r\\nLearn more about our FOI obligations and how to make a request.", "short_summary": "You can contact us in a number of ways."}	2016-08-02 00:19:27.301383
