76	13	93	\N	Contact	contact	3	2016-07-14 01:37:32.404079	2016-07-29 06:17:08.869026	GeneralContent	\N	published	4c341ded-76d5-45e6-8256-30b765ff08b2	\N	\N	{"name": "Contact", "content_body": "## Parliament Office\\r\\n\\r\\n### Email\\r\\n\\r\\n[minister@border.gov.au](mailto:minister@border.gov.au)\\r\\n\\r\\n[Contact form](#)\\r\\n\\r\\n### Phone\\r\\n\\r\\n[02 6277 7860](tel:0262777860)  \\r\\n9am to 5pm AEST (Australian Eastern Standard Time)  \\r\\nMonday to Friday excluding ACT public holidays\\r\\n\\r\\nFax: 02 6273 4144\\r\\n\\r\\n### Postal address\\r\\n\\r\\nMinister for Immigration and Border Protection  \\r\\nPO Box 6022  \\r\\nParliament House  \\r\\nCanberra ACT 2600\\r\\n\\r\\n### Social media\\r\\n\\r\\nMr Dutton’s personal accounts.\\r\\n\\r\\nFacebook: [Peter Dutton](https://www.facebook.com/peterduttonmp)  \\r\\nTwitter: [@PeterDutton_MP](https://twitter.com/PeterDutton_MP)\\r\\n\\r\\n### Privacy\\r\\n\\r\\nAny personal details you share with us will only be used to reply to your message and not for any other purpose, except as authorised by the [Privacy Act](#).", "short_summary": "You can contact the Minister in a number of ways."}	2016-07-29 06:17:08.866751
