93	13	81	\N	\N	minister-for-immigration-and-border-protection	11	2016-07-14 04:41:27.147167	2016-08-02 00:44:14.355729	SectionHome	\N	published	b3cd4f25-d9b1-4318-bf74-2fed9bca537f	\N	\N	{"name": "Minister for Immigration and Border Protection", "content_body": "## About the Minister\\r\\n\\r\\n![Hon Peter Dutton MP](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AusDTO/gov-au-images/master/ministers/peter-dutton-hero.jpg)\\r\\n\\r\\n**The Hon Peter Dutton MP**  \\r\\nLiberal Party  \\r\\nMr Dutton was appointed Minister for Immigration and Border Protection on 23 December 2014.\\r\\n\\r\\n[More on the Minister](/minister-for-immigration-and-border-protection/about-the-minister)\\r\\n\\r\\n## Responsibilities\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Minister for Immigration and Border Protection leads the [Immigration and Border Protection](/department-of-immigration-and-border-protection) and other agencies within the government's Immigration and Border Protection portfolio.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Department and agencies provide information and services related to various immigration and border protection issues such as visas, citizenship and moving to Australia.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Minister works with government organisations, the community and professional associations to create and update immigration and border protection laws.\\r\\n\\r\\n[More about responsibilities](/minister-for-immigration-and-border-protection/responsibilities)\\r\\n\\r\\n## Contact\\r\\n\\r\\n**Parliament Office**  \\r\\nEmail: [minister@border.gov.au](mailto:minister@border.gov.au)  \\r\\nPhone number: [02 6277 7860](tel:0262777860)  \\r\\n\\r\\n[More contact details](/minister-for-immigration-and-border-protection/contact)", "short_summary": "The Minister advises the Australian Government about Australia’s border and the movement of people and goods across it."}	2016-08-02 00:44:14.351654
