268	11	\N	\N	\N	2016-07-29-nola-marino-re-appointed-as-chief-government-whip	0	2016-07-28 23:40:48.422761	2016-07-28 23:40:51.498184	NewsArticle	{"release_date": "2016-07-29"}	published	381de154-d53b-4a02-adeb-e62f9da6c920	\N	\N	{"name": "Nola Marino re-appointed as Chief Government Whip", "options": {}, "content_body": "Nola will continue to perform this vitally important role with great skill. She is held in the highest esteem by her colleagues and I greatly value her counsel and support.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe full House whips team will be announced when there is clarity about the result in the seat of Herbert.\\r\\n\\r\\nI also thank Brett Whiteley for his service as Government Whip. ", "short_summary": "I am pleased to announce the re-appointment of Ms Nola Marino as the Chief Government Whip."}	2016-07-28 23:40:51.496237
