228	6	\N	\N	\N	2016-07-11-changes-to-the-special-humanitarian-programme	0	2016-07-27 03:50:40.810426	2016-07-27 04:55:15.167987	NewsArticle	{"release_date": "2016-07-11"}	published	8b216b3e-4572-47e2-b0d1-fe903f71aaff	\N	\N	{"name": "Changes to the Special Humanitarian Programme", "options": {}, "summary": "", "content_body": "From 1 July 2016, the Offshore Humanitarian Processing Centres changed their name to the Special Humanitarian Processing Centres (SHPC).\\r\\n\\r\\nThey continue to be located in Melbourne (Victoria) and Sydney (New South Wales).\\r\\n\\r\\nThere is also a change to application lodgement arrangements. From 1 July 2016, applicants residing in Pakistan and Afghanistan should lodge their applications at the SHPC in Sydney.", "short_summary": "The Offshore Humanitarian Processing Centres changed their name to the Special Humanitarian Processing Centres (SHPC)"}	2016-07-27 04:55:15.165888
